const shorten = text => String(text).replace(/\((?:node:|bun:|internal[:\/])[^()]*\)/g, "(a module of Bun)").replace(/(?:file:\/\/)?(?:[A-Z]:)?[\\\/][^\s():]*[\\\/]/g, "");
function framesOf(stack, count = 6) {
